{"title":"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/e/3eeb0eca26a6ceb715497696bd1ba1157eb262b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\zeta_1, \\zeta_2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/2/5d29fea9e49cbef023695f7744db1942861f97ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\zeta_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"14\" height=\"16\" /> are <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Complex_number\" title=\"Complex number\">complex numbers</a> such that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/f/20f1cdf3667c7b392addc8b1658aef13e0a65918.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\zeta_1+\\zeta_2+\\zeta_3=1\\]\" width=\"122\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/0/1905da989b086b38a25f8d01de7119ca8dc675d1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\zeta_1^2+\\zeta_2^2+\\zeta_3^2=3\\]\" width=\"127\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/a/fcaa6db09874632947ab41ccd40e1f90e3311b44.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\zeta_1^3+\\zeta_2^3+\\zeta_3^3=7\\]\" width=\"127\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Compute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/0/8e0d9cd00cf92a13011e567d8eabbcd6f6ccec08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\zeta_1^{7} + \\zeta_2^{7} + \\zeta_3^{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/7/2f7cc81745880e66967fe4e20e62c858260c7884.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e_1 = \\zeta_1 + \\zeta_2 + \\zeta_3,\\ e_2 = \\zeta_1\\zeta_2 + \\zeta_2\\zeta_3 + \\zeta_3\\zeta_1,\\ e_3 = \\zeta_1\\zeta_2\\zeta_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"420\" height=\"16\" /> (the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Elementary_symmetric_sums&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Elementary symmetric sums (page does not exist)\">elementary symmetric sums</a>). Then, we can rewrite the above equations as\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/e/83e28ea00ae7b53d77e12ff22900374d431cc2de.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\zeta_1+\\zeta_2+\\zeta_3=e_1 = 1\\]\" width=\"162\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/b/2dbd6dece2117341b07590d218f1b74ef7a2cce3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\zeta_1^2+\\zeta_2^2+\\zeta_3^2= e_1^2 - 2e_2 = 3\\]\" width=\"214\" height=\"19\" />\nfrom where it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/2/b72b7ca1b03213c39ca9732ccc9e52fd1100607c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e_2 = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"62\" height=\"14\" />. The third equation can be factored as \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/4/7648d05b4643d4570678215d3ebc4a31b7ae6d2d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[7 =\\zeta_1^3+\\zeta_2^3+\\zeta_3^3 = (\\zeta_1+\\zeta_2+\\zeta_3)(\\zeta_1^2+\\zeta_2^2+\\zeta_3^2-\\zeta_1\\zeta_2-\\zeta_2\\zeta_3 -\\zeta_3\\zeta_1)+3\\zeta_1\\zeta_2\\zeta_3\\\\ = e_1^3 - 3e_1e_2 + 3e_3,\\]\" width=\"659\" height=\"19\" />\nfrom where it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/8/cc857ffb1761e8c7317e162fce8e2d530ff868fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e_3 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"48\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, applying <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s formulas\">Vieta's formulas</a> backwards, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/e/3eeb0eca26a6ceb715497696bd1ba1157eb262b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\zeta_1, \\zeta_2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/2/5d29fea9e49cbef023695f7744db1942861f97ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\zeta_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"14\" height=\"16\" /> are the roots of the polynomial\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/6/226f7e0b22c5aa7b367db210135911e418bb4b4c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^3 - x^2 - x - 1 = 0 \\Longleftrightarrow x^3 = x^2 + x + 1\\]\" width=\"321\" height=\"16\" />\nLet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/f/39f43d436722d2b363996a9f3ec4ee1da83d6984.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_n = \\zeta_1^n + \\zeta_2^n + \\zeta_3^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"140\" height=\"17\" /> (the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Power_sums&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Power sums (page does not exist)\">power sums</a>). Then from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />, we have the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Recursion\" title=\"Recursion\">recursion</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/a/6aabbaae13611ac9cab44ca41e533d8e910c297b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_{n+3} = s_{n+2} + s_{n+1} + s_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"188\" height=\"14\" />. It follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/4/b7478cfc4e49af7021377defb73a4f13cb84f554.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_4 = 7 + 3 + 1 = 11, s_5 = 21, s_6 = 39, s_7 = \\boxed{071}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"374\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005\">Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t={{{source}}}\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_Pre_2005_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 Pre 2005 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017153933\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 168/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1429/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 175/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3869/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.643      1 Template:Mock_AIME_box\n100.00%   